h - 0.15)\n  :timeout -> max(0.0, old_strength - 0.05)\nend"},{"id":"blk-46642","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-54222","text":"Tests"}]},{"id":"blk-46643","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-46645","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54223","text":"Successful outcome strengthens causal edge"}]}],"id":"blk-46644","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-46647","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54224","text":"Failed outcome weakens causal edge"}]}],"id":"blk-46646","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-46649","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54225","text":"causal_strength persists in edge metadata"}]}],"id":"blk-46648","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-46651","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54226","text":"confounders field accepted and stored"}]}],"id":"blk-46650","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-46652","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54227","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-46653","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-54228","text":"GraphMemBench Phase 3: Full Suite + Competitor Stubs (3 days)"}]},{"id":"blk-46654","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-54229","text":"Add remaining 40 scenarios (Categories 11-15, 8 each)"}]},{"id":"blk-46655","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54230","marks":["bold"],"text":"Category 11: Causal Metadata (8 scenarios)"}]},{"id":"blk-46656","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-46658","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54231","text":"causal_strength updates on outcome success"}]}],"id":"blk-46657","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-46660","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54232","text":"causal_strength decreases on failure"}]}],"id":"blk-46659","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-46662","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54233","text":"confounders stored in edge metadata"}]}],"id":"blk-46661","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-46664","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54234","text":"Causal subgraph extraction (al